{
  "name": "dsh-napcat-log",
  "version": "0.1.2",
  "description": "桥接 NapCat（QQ 机器人框架）的运行日志与登录二维码的 DSH 插件（纯 JS、零运行时依赖，只用 node 内置）：一只工具 napcat_log、六个动作 —— status（在不在跑、跑的是重定向还是窗口模式、WebUI 地址与 token、当前登录码还剩多少秒、NapCat 装在哪、怎么钉死）| read（尾读 logs/napcat-out.txt：正则或子串筛选、最近 N 分钟、UTF-8/GBK 自动判并回报用了哪种）| qr（把当前码快照成 logs/qrcode-latest.png 并当图片附件回会话）| start|restart|stop（脱管起停：stdio ignore + detached + unref，调用立刻返回，NapCat 不挂在会话或宿主底下）。它只读文件与起停进程：不发 QQ 消息、不起定时器、不加界面分区。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./skills/*.md": "./skills/*.md",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "ecbob",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/ecbob/dsh-napcat-log.git"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "cordis",
    "napcat",
    "napcatqq",
    "qq",
    "bot",
    "onebot",
    "log",
    "bridge",
    "qrcode"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "skills",
    "scripts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": ">=0.2.0-rc.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill": ">=0.2.0-rc.2"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "check": "node --check index.js && node --check scripts/selftest.mjs",
    "test": "npm run check && node scripts/selftest.mjs",
    "pack": "npm pack --pack-destination dist"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "compatibility": {
      "dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.2"
    }
  }
}
